          "jd_text": "About the job\n\nTCS Hiring for Senior Java Cloud Developer\n\n\n\n\nExperience Range: - 06 To 10 Years (Mandatory)\n\n(Note: Candidates below 6 years of IT experience shall not be considered)\n\nJOB LOCATION: Bengaluru, Chennai & Hyderabad\n\n\n\n\nJOB DESCRIPTION\n\n\n\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n\n\n\n\nMicroservices Development: Design and develop robust REST APIs and distributed backend services using Java, Spring Boot, and Spring Framework. \nContainerization: Package Java applications into secure, lightweight container images using Docker.\nOrchestration & Deployment: Manage workloads on Kubernetes (EKS, AKS, or GKE); configure Deployments, Services, ConfigMaps, Secrets, health probes, and resource limits.\nCloud Infrastructure: Leverage public cloud services (AWS or Azure) for storage, networking, database management, and load balancing. \nCI/CD & Automation: Build, maintain, and optimize automated deployment pipelines for continuous integration, vulnerability scanning, testing, and rollout.\nObservability: Set up application monitoring, logging, and performance.\n\n\n\n\nRequired Qualifications & Skills:\n\n\n\n\nProfessional software engineering experience.\nProgramming Languages: Advanced proficiency in Java and modern frameworks (Spring Boot, Spring Cloud, JPA).\nContainer Tools: Hands-on experience with Docker and image optimization for Java runtimes.\nOrchestration: Solid understanding of Kubernetes clustering, ingress controllers, and service discovery.\nCloud Platforms: Practical working experience with at least one major cloud provider (AWS or Azure).\nCloud certifications such as AWS/Azure Certified Solutions Architect or Certified Kubernetes Application Developer (CKAD).\nDevOps & CI/CD: Familiarity with Git, Jenkins, GitHub Actions, or Terraform (Infrastructure as Code). \n\n\n\n\nMinimum Qualification:\n\n15 years of Full Time Education\n\n\n\n\nInterested candidates kindly share your updated resume to govind.vijayan@tcs.com along with filling the following details to maximize your chances of getting calls from TCS. The details are as follows:\n\n\n\n\nSection 1: Basic Details:\n\nCandidate Name:\nEmail ID:\nPhone Number:\nCurrent Location (City):\nPreferred Location (City):\n\n\n\n\nSection 2: Educational Details:\n\nHighest Regular Full‑Time Qualification\n(Diploma / Graduation / Post Graduation / Others)\n10th Completion Year\n12th / Intermediate Completion Year\nGraduation Completion Year\nPost‑Graduation Completion Year (if applicable)\n\n\n\n\nSection 3: Work Experience:\n\nCurrent Company Name\nTotal Experience (in years)\nNumber of Companies Worked\nEmployment Timeline\n(Example: Company A – 2021 to Present, Company B – 2019 to 2021)\n\n\n\n\nSection 4: Compensation Details:\n\n\n\n\nCurrent CTC (in LPA)\nExpected CTC (in LPA)\nNotice Period\n(Immediate / 15 Days / 30 Days / 60+ Days)\n\n\n\n\nSection 5: Documentation & Compliance (Yes / No):\n\n\n\n\nValid ID Proof Available (Aadhar & Pan Card): (Yes/No)\nEducational Documents Available: (Yes/No)\nEmployment Documents Available: (Yes/No)\nUAN Number Available: (Yes/No)\n\n\n\n\nRequirements added by the job poster\n\n• 6+ years of work experience with Java\n\n• 6+ years of work experience with Microservices\n\n• 6+ years of work experience with Spring Boot\n"
